18512::$$$message_0143_0000_0000$$$::"Huh? It's already over? Where's your spine?[lr]::
18513::$$$message_0143_0000_0001$$$::I guess you need to rest if you're tired."::
18514::$$$message_0143_0001_0000$$$::"Okay, let's call it a night. Come back when you feel like it, ya hear?[humming][lr]::
