18516::$$$message_0143_0001_0002$$$::Ai wo Torimodose!"::
18517::$$$message_0143_0002_0000$$$::"...Huh, what's that?[lr]::
18518::$$$message_0143_0002_0001$$$::What's that, some classified intel? Hmm, I don't get it so I'll feed it into the sweet potato bonfire!"::
